    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Corry Estates are delighted to welcome to the market number 22 Seabury Lane, a fine 3 bedroom semi-detached family home with the benefit of a sunny south facing rear garden with paved patio area. Upon entering, viewers will be impressed by the bright and spacious living accommodation which comprises of reception hall, living room complete with a marble fireplace and a feature bay window, double doors lead into the open plan kitchen/dining area. A guest W.C. completes the ground floor accommodation. At first floor level, there are 3 generous sized bedrooms and a family bathroom. Further features include gas fired central heating, solid oak flooring, PVC double glazed windows, cobblelock driveway, side entrance and a sunny south facing rear garden with paved patio area and astro grass. The property is perfectly located on a quiet tree lined road within this much sought after residential area. Ideally positioned within walking distance of local shops, schools, Malahide estuary and commuter bus links. Nearby Malahide Village has a host of cafes, restaurants, shopping boutiques and a Dart station. Viewing for this fine family home comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall\r\n4.55m (14'11\") x 1.74m (5'9\") Solid oak wood flooring. \r\nUnderstair storage\r\n\r\nGuest W.C\r\nComprising of W.C. & W.H.B. Fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.84m (15'11\") x 3.37m (11'1\") Feature marble fireplace with \r\ncast iron inset and gas fire. Solid oak flooring. TV point. Bay \r\nwindow. Double doors lead to Kitchen/Dining area.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area\r\n3.36m (11'0\") x 5.23m (17'2\") Range of fitted press units. Semi\u0002solid oak flooring. Plumbed for washing machine. Double \r\ndoors to rear garden.\r\n\r\n1st Floor \r\nLanding\r\n2.85m (9'4\") x 1.89m (6'2\") Access to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.64m (11'11\") x 3.24m (10'8\") Built-in wardrobes. Varnished \r\nfloorboards.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.7m (12'2\") x 3.24m (10'8\") Built-in wardrobes. Varnished \r\nfloorboards. TV point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.76m (9'1\") x 2.26m (7'5\") Built-in wardrobes. Varnished\r\nfloorboards.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.13m (7'0\") x 1.88m (6'2\") Comprising of bath, shower, W.H.B. \r\n& W.C. Fully tiled walls and flooring\r\n\r\nOutside: Walled gardens to front with cobble lock driveway and flowerbed. Side entrance to rear.\r\nPrivate south facing low maintenance rear garden with patio area, lawn, border flowerbeds and barna shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Sunny south facing rear garden, with paved patio area.\r\n\r\nGas-fired radiator central heating.\r\n\r\nLocated on a quiet & mature tree lined road.\r\n\r\nWalking distance to local shops, schools, public transport links and Malahide Estuary."
      },
